# Copy to .env.local and fill in. `.env.local` is git-ignored.
#
# PEXELS_API_KEY — optional, but strongly recommended.
#
# Used by `.opencode/skills/sawonmart-assets/scripts/fetch-stock-images.mjs`.
# Get a free key at https://www.pexels.com/api/
#
# The Pexels License allows free commercial use with no attribution required,
# and — unlike Openverse — its library is real product photography. Without a
# key the fetcher falls back to Openverse, whose CC0 pool is Flickr snapshots
# and museum archive scans; verified by eye, a "blender" search there returns a
# photograph of a church.
#
# PEXELS_API_KEY=

# Firebase web config. Optional — src/lib/firebaseConfig.js already contains the
# values for project `sawonstore-b`. Set these only to point at another project.
#
# VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=
# VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=
# VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=
# VITE_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=
# VITE_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=
# VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID=
# VITE_FIREBASE_MEASUREMENT_ID=